    "## Match case (Switch case)\n",
    "\n",
    "`match` `case` este echivalentul lui `switch` `case` din `C++` sau alte limbaje de programare."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 16,
   "id": "3a33723b",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "two\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "value = 2\n",
    "match value:\n",
    "    case 1:\n",
    "        result = \"one\"\n",
    "    case 2:\n",
    "        result = \"two\"\n",
    "    case 3:\n",
    "        result = \"three\"\n",
    "    case _:\n",
    "        result = \"unknown\"\n",
    "print(result)"
   ]
